From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hariharan <14965074+cvhariharan@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 11:52:37 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] chore: attribution, AGPL notice and source code link

Show the product name without "Team Edition", replace the community link
with an attribution to Mattermost, add the AGPL notice with a link to the
running version's source code (AGPL section 13), and drop the links to
Mattermost's terms of use and privacy policy, which don't cover a
self-hosted Mattermax server.

Mattermax-Patch: about-dialog.patch
